On Thu, 2016-08-11 at 05:59 -0700, Burak Gunhan wrote:
> Dear INLA experts,
>
> I want to use INLA to fit random effects meta-analysis models. I can
> fit a Normal-Normal hierarchical model with INLA (observations are
> normally distributed and latent variable is normally distributed).
> But, I also want to fit a Normal-Student t hierarchical model as
> suggested here http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17477434.
>
