Hi!

I looked at the logfile: This one looks good, nice behaviour and convergence!

Summary: This also looks good, with one small exception:
avSlopeGreenUp_mixedforest  has a mean of 81.6

The defaul prior is a gaussian with standard deviation 31 for fixed effects. This may impact any fixed effects with a mean estimate > 20, in a way you do not want.

Is it possible for you to rescale this covariate? Otherwise we can just change the prior precision for the fixed effects!

Haakon

